<title>USA: ESC Medical Q4 Dec 31 full results.</title>
<headline>ESC Medical Q4 Dec 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				December 31,	  December 31,</p>
<p>				(unaudited)	     (audited)</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales	  $11,578,021  $3,682,556 $32,862,936  $8,398,247</p>
